<div class="modal-section">
<p>During three years at Bpacks I led development of multiple biodegradable composite formulations for rigid food packaging, covering injection molding and thermoforming applications.</p>

<p>The work combined formulation design, laboratory characterization, twin-screw compounding, pilot production, customer trials, regulatory evaluation for food-contact materials, and continuous process optimization.</p>

<p>Several formulations progressed from laboratory concepts to pilot-scale validation and commercial demonstrations, including materials based on bark-filled biodegradable polymer systems.</p>
</div>
